# drum circle Sunshine Coast

Join us for Saturplay a free drum circle with eats, drinks, drums and good vibes! Held at Renae's Pantry on the last Saturday of every month.  There will be lots of instruments, new friends, good food, drumming, dancing and lots of fun.  Pop your email down on the list and go in the draw to win another exciting prize for the month of June and don't forget there will be yummy food and drinks available all made by Renaes Pantry. Save your grocery shopping until Saturday afternoon and come on down for a lovely relaxed afternoon with local community and good music. See you all there!

## **Saturplay**

June 27th 2-6pm The Lane, [Renae's Pantry](https://www.facebook.com/RenaesPantry?fref=ts), 4-6 Main St Palmwoods 4555 Like us on [Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/RhythmCultureOZ?ref=hl) for to keep updated on this event. _All ages welcome, grab a drum and come play!_ _Saturplay is held on the last Saturday of every month!_ To read more info about Saturplay see us in the [Sunshine Coast Daily](http://www.sunshinecoastdaily.com.au/news/drumming-good-vibes/2643396/)
